.el .ds Aq '
.TH SPT-ABOUT 1  "about " 
.SH NAME
about \- List bundled libraries and their licenses
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBabout\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List bundled libraries and their licenses
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
about\-list(1)
List every bundled library, one line per entry
.TP
about\-show(1)
Show detailed information for a single library
.TP
about\-licenses(1)
Group bundled libraries by SPDX license, with counts
.TP
about\-export(1)
Write attribution data to a file (format inferred from extension)
.TP
about\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
